OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fpleasantly warm evening with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine and staying generally dry
OL,8,Fovernight with long clear periods.
OL,9,FTurning rather fresh with rural spots
OL,10,Fbecoming quite chilly. A small chance
OL,11,Fof an isolated light shower in western
OL,12,Fcoastal areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA mainly sunny start and
OL,15,Fsoon warming up. Fair weather cloud
OL,16,Fbubbling up, but lengthy sunny periods
OL,17,Fcontinuing throughout the afternoon.
OL,18,FSome wispy high cloud is likely later.
OL,19,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
