OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fwarm on Sunday with hazy sunshine.
OL,7,FBecoming very warm and humid again
OL,8,Fearly next week with an increasing
OL,9,Fchance of showers and welcome rain for
OL,10,Fsome by Tuesday.
